<title>USA: Douglas Cty, Wash., P.U.D. #1 Wells tender offer.</title>
<headline>Douglas Cty, Wash., P.U.D. #1 Wells tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr Brothers &amp; Co said on Monday it is acting as agent and accepting tender offers on the following Douglas County, Wash., P.U.D. #1 Wells Hydroelectric revenue bonds:</p>
<p>Series 1963 4 pct due 9/1/2018</p>
<p>Series 1965 3.70 pct due 9/1/2018</p>
<p>Tenders will be accepted Wednesday 10/30/1996 from 1100 EST to 1400 EST for settlement Monday, November 4, 1996.</p>
<p>The authority said it reserves the right to reject any or call offers.</p>
<p>Please contact Bob Zmuidins at 212-363-4090 or fax to 212-269-7637.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
